<![CDATA[<span style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Contact.Name},</span><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">The pricing on your purchase order does not match our system price, please adjust your records to reflect this current pricing. Your Order is not on hold and is moving through our system. Any changes to your order could result in changes to this pricing.</span><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><ul><li><span style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">PO Number:&nbsp;</span><font face="source sans pro">{!EBS_Order__c.Customer_PO__c}</font></li><li>Order Number:&nbsp;<font face="source sans pro" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!EBS_Order__c.EBS_Order_Number__c}</font></li></ul><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">Please follow the link below for more information:</span><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><h2 class="pageDescription" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0px; line-height: 1.1em;"><span style="font-weight: normal;"><font face="source sans pro" size="3">{!EBS_Order__c.Tracking_Link_Formula__c}</font></span></h2><a href="https://kooziegroup--full--c.documentforce.com/email/templaterenderer?id=00X53000000DyYU&amp;base_href=https%3A%2F%2Fkooziegroup--full.my.salesforce.com&amp;preview_frame=previewFrame&amp;render_type=REPLACED_HTML_BODY&amp;setupid=CommunicationTemplatesEmail" style="text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178); font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro Black&quot;, sans-serif;"></a><br style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;"><p style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">All the best,<br>The Anchor Wallace Krew</p>]]></td>
